We'll use three separate buckets:

thanos-<account-id>-ap-south-1
loki-<account-id>-ap-south-1
tempo-<account-id>-ap-south-1

Make sure AWS identity is correct
aws sts get-caller-identity

{
    "UserId": "045667250694",
    "Account": "045667250694",
    "Arn": "arn:aws:iam::045667250694:root"
}


export AWS_REGION=ap-south-1
export AWS_ACCOUNT_ID=$(aws sts get-caller-identity --query Account --output text)

export THANOS_BUCKET="thanos-${AWS_ACCOUNT_ID}-${AWS_REGION}"
export LOKI_BUCKET="loki-${AWS_ACCOUNT_ID}-${AWS_REGION}"
export TEMPO_BUCKET="tempo-${AWS_ACCOUNT_ID}-${AWS_REGION}"

Verify:

echo $AWS_ACCOUNT_ID
echo $THANOS_BUCKET
echo $LOKI_BUCKET
echo $TEMPO_BUCKET

Expected:

